{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.poster.avif?t=1761555087\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.webm?t=1761555087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.mp4?t=1761555087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong><br>Lysa Hora in Kyiv has always been shrouded in dark legends. Whispers tell of pagan rituals, secret military bunkers, and experiments that were never meant to be seen. But for the protagonist, it all begins with nightmares. At night, visions of underground chambers and strange symbols haunt his sleep; by day, an uneasy feeling lingers, as if the dreams themselves are calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn by these recurring visions, he sets out for Lysa Hora to uncover what lies behind them. With every step, the boundary between dream and reality grows thinner, and soon it becomes clear \u2014 the nightmares were only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.poster.avif?t=1761555087\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.webm?t=1761555087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.mp4?t=1761555087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>This is an atmospheric horror experience set in locations inspired by real places: the remains of an old fortress, labyrinths of underground tunnels, a foreboding forest, and ancient shrines. Players will explore, solve intricate puzzles that demand focus and logic, and overcome obstacles with light parkour elements as they descend deeper into the heart of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery brings you closer to the truth, but also unveils an ancient horror that has been buried beneath the hill for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All locations \u2014 and the game itself \u2014 are crafted by the former Lead Level Designer of a renowned game about Chernobyl, ensuring a world built with exceptional detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963490?t=1761555087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963490?t=1761555087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/651a5148356fe6c2d10c906a61844407489db596/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761555087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/651a5148356fe6c2d10c906a61844407489db596/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761555087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/e